+       "| REQ-AAA-004 | lint | GAP-03 | a lint row |\n"),),
+     ["WAIVER ON A ROW NEEDING NO CHECK REQ-AAA-004"]),
+    (((str(VERIFY), "| REQ-AAA-003 | STORM | GAP-02 | no storm check of this row |\n",
